  ▎ user only opens a browser."
  ▎
  ▎ 1. "The browser talks to mir_ui, our backend, over HTTP. Every request carries a login token, and the body is just JSON. The camera
  ▎ comes separately, over a WebSocket — a stream that stays open, which is good for video." (orange)
